OL,3,GNEWSA'Jack Grealish put #10k towards my
OL,4,Ahusband's cancer treatment'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother-of-three said she was left
OL,7,F"frozen in shock" after discovering
OL,8,Ffootballer Jack Grealish had donated
OL,9,F#10,000 towards her husband's cancer
OL,10,Ftreatment.
OL,12,FCrystal Duffey, from Southport,
OL,13,Flaunched a fundraising appeal after her
OL,14,Fhusband, Leon Skapars, 36, was
OL,15,Fdiagnosed with a rare kidney cancer and
OL,16,Ftold he had between 12 months and three
OL,17,Fyears to live.
OL,19,FShe said Grealish's contribution could
OL,20,Fhelp fund clinical trials and give Leon
OL,21,Fmore time with their three children.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
